holds the three-rank declaration of the Flash-Next fixture: the three
programs declare the same ops and KV groups in the same order; every
rank the two-rank attention geometry with the span of its heads, rank 2
zero; the delta net 6/5/5 K and 18/15/15 V heads as per-part spans of
[q|k|v|z] and the conv channels, a span of A_log, the output columns,
and the state group at each rank's own V count. The fake builder
